flowchart TD
    A[Queue task] --> B[Persist task in SQLite]
    B --> C{Dependencies satisfied?}
    C -- No --> D[Wait / block]
    C -- Yes --> E[Worker claims task]
    E --> F[Create/use managed worktree]
    F --> G[Run agent in task worktree]
    G --> H{Cancelled?}
    H -- Yes --> I[Cooperative cancellation]
    H -- No --> J[Persist result / error]
    J --> K[Review branch + changes]
    K --> L{Promote work?}
    L -- No --> M[Retain/clean up safely]
    L -- Yes --> N[Commit / push / PR]
    N --> O{Merged and worktree clean?}
    O -- Yes --> P[Safe cleanup]
    O -- No --> Q[Keep managed worktree]
